@host = http://localhost:5069

### Öğretmen girişi (Development seed hesabı) — yanıttaki token'ı aşağıya kopyalayın
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ogretmen@ots.local", "password": "Ogretmen123!" }

###
@token = BURAYA_TOKEN

### Oturum bilgisi
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Öğretmen ana sayfası
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Öğrencileri listele (yalnızca giriş yapan öğretmenin öğrencileri)
GET {{host}}/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Öğrenci ekle
POST {{host}}/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Ayşe", "lastName": "Yılmaz", "email": "ayse@example.com", "gradeLevel": 7 }

### Öğrenci detayı (velilerle)
GET {{host}}/api/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Öğrenci güncelle
PUT {{host}}/api/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Ayşe", "lastName": "Demir", "email": "ayse@example.com", "gradeLevel": 8 }

### Geçersiz istek (400 beklenir)
POST {{host}}/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "", "lastName": "X", "gradeLevel": 99 }

### Öğrenciye veli hesabı oluştur ve bağla
POST {{host}}/api/students/1/parents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Fatma Yılmaz", "email": "fatma@example.com", "password": "Veli1234!" }

### Veli şifresini yenile
PUT {{host}}/api/students/1/parents/2/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "YeniSifre123" }

### Veliyi öğrenciden kaldır
DELETE {{host}}/api/students/1/parents/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dersleri listele (konularla)
GET {{host}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ders ekle
POST {{host}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Matematik" }

### Derse konu ekle
POST {{host}}/api/courses/1/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kesirler", "order": 1 }

### Konu güncelle
PUT {{host}}/api/topics/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kesirler ve Ondalıklar", "order": 1 }

### Öğrencinin ilerlemesi (öğretmen veya bağlı veli)
GET {{host}}/api/students/1/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### İlerleme güncelle (NotStarted | InProgress | Completed) — yalnızca öğretmen
PUT {{host}}/api/students/1/progress/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Completed", "note": "Testten 90 aldı." }

### Veli: çocuklarım (veli token'ı ile)
GET {{host}}/api/my/children
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Veli: son gelişmeler (veli token'ı ile)
GET {{host}}/api/my/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Şifre değiştir
PUT {{host}}/api/auth/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "Ogretmen123!", "newPassword": "YeniSifre123" }

### Konu sil
DELETE {{host}}/api/topics/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ders sil (konular ve ilerlemeler de silinir)
DELETE {{host}}/api/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Öğrenci sil
DELETE {{host}}/api/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
